feed, write-catalog-snapshot-with-announcement-feed, same-origin checksum-bound catalog announcement feed routes with strict feed-envelope validation, inspect-catalog-snapshot, and batch write-catalog-snapshot-with-announcements publication; broad P2P discovery, relays, NAT traversal, and swarm transfer remain roadmap until implemented.",
  "NuGet public publication status on 2026-07-07: the protected source-level TinyRustLM.Abstractions, TinyRustLM.Core, TinyRustLM.P2P, and TinyRustLM.Memory lane remains the source/API boundary, while public NuGet.org availability is carried by the branded UAIX.Browser.Core.Abstractions, UAIX.Browser.p2pLLM.Runtime, UAIX.Browser.p2pRuntime.P2P, UAIX.Browser.Memory, and UAIX.Browser.p2pLLM.Conversion package IDs, all published and post-publish verified at version 0.1.8 with matching .snupkg symbol sidecars and SHA256SUMS-bound feed-hash evidence.",
